f 0s and 1s, where 1 represents a queen.</li><li data-ref="163286ab-8270-4a19-b621-c97b42ce4e65">If no solution exists, print: "No solution exists for N = &lt;value&gt;".</li><li data-ref="100e3b0a-aa25-4f97-8c75-50aab0afc053">Each row of the matrix should be printed on a new line, with space-separated values.</li></ul><p data-ref="1453c814-6e7f-4adc-9a8a-172635f17dd4" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="85cd52bd-97c4-4cdc-8c37-62540004e745"></p><p data-ref="f981b4af-0ec7-4b6d-b6c5-1052a6b9c9a5" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="94d356c9-7314-4eee-8547-c002238b5429">Note:</strong> Refer to the test cases for better understanding.</p></span></div><div class="mb-3" data-ref="469ad8a0-94e3-464a-8d3b-aa35f0a329b5" data-split-to="469ad8a0-94e3-464a-8d3b-aa35f0a329b5" data-split-original="true" data-last-split-element="true" data-align-last-split-element="auto"><div class="ml-1 mb-3" data-ref="3e664082-b2ce-4b43-8e6b-f8825c4bd4e7"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="5c62073c-2e62-4b09-9b26-20024b63732a" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Source Code: </b></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
